 "title": "74AHC244 / 74AHCT244 octal buffer and line driver with 3-state outputs",
 "source": {
  "document": "74AHC_AHCT244",
  "revision": "Rev. 7, 20 September 2023",
  "pages": 16
 },
 "summary": "Eight non-inverting buffers with 3-state outputs, arranged as two banks of four. Each bank has its own active-LOW enable (1OE, 2OE); with the enable HIGH the bank's outputs go high-impedance. The 74AHC244 has CMOS input thresholds and runs from 2.0 V to 5.5 V; the 74AHCT244 has TTL input thresholds and runs from 4.5 V to 5.5 V. All inputs have Schmitt-trigger action and are overvoltage tolerant to 5.5 V, which lets the part translate between logic voltages. Packages are SO20, TSSOP20 and DHVQFN20, specified from -40 °C to +125 °C.",
 "key_figures": [
